{"id": "q0103", "pool": "frozen", "arm": "conservative", "tier": "conservative", "lang": "en", "run_id": "ttfa1", "attempt": 1, "seed": 867536581, "protocol": "ttfa-v3", "config_sha256": "1bd884090589f25ac8e99f9bb754f4b90b4c7a09d6887616d0aefbdba25a74d4", "gate_art_sha256": "0e6494c2eeac9bcd86c10b5def3cbd32e98bb0765fa2fd8afc8c1b47915ea372", "threshold": 0.9057239890098572, "gpu": "NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3", "host": "modal", "shard": 5, "query": "The data in the table below shows the percent of bus riders in a survey of Central H.S. students; 300 males and 300 females in each grade were surveyed. For which grade is the number of its male bus riders closest to $135\\%$ of the number of its female bus riders? \\begin{tabular}{|l|c|c|}\\hline\nGrade & Males & Females \\\\ \\hline\n$9^{\\mathrm{th}}$ grade & $41.1\\%$ & $39.4\\%$ \\\\ \\hline\n$10^{\\mathrm{th}}$ grade & $34.4\\%$ & $33.1\\%$ \\\\ \\hline\n$11^{\\mathrm{th}}$ grade & $20.6\\%$ & $13.8\\%$ \\\\ \\hline\n$12^{\\mathrm{th}}$ grade & $11.6\\%$ & $8.6\\%$ \\\\ \\hline\n\\end{tabular}\n\nSolve and give the final answer.", "input_path": "/data/audio_pool/q0103.wav", "input_sha256": "adbc6ffc5dc5203fb5bd83ab83bfe8ae216fcd2142658aed2c0feeef3dc61470", "input_samples": 675000, "input_s": 42.188, "n_real_chunks": 43, "score": 0.8105, "act": 0.9998, "is_info": true, "fired": false, "mode": "local", "answer": "So, we have a table here that shows the percentage of bus riders among Central H S students. There are 30 0 males and 300 females in each grade who were surveyed. We need to find out which grade has the number of male bus riders closest to 1 3 5% of the number of female bus riders. Let' s look at the data for each grade. For Grade 9, there's a 49% of male bus riders compared to 4 1. 1% of female bus riders. If we take 41.1% of 30 0 female bus rid ers, that gives us about 1 2 3 ma le bus riders. That's pretty close to 135%. Moving on to Grade 10, we see 3 4.4% of males versus 36. 6% of females. Calcul ating 36. 6% of 3 00 gives us around 1 1 0 male bus rid ers. That is further from 1 35%. Now, for G rade 11, it's 35. 8% for males and 3 4.4%", "relay_text": "", "expert_answer": "", "transcript": "", "asr_s": null, "expert_s": null, "expert_input_samples": null, "expert_input_s": null, "expert_input_sha256": null, "expert_timed_out": false, "wait_s": null, "relay_synth_ms": null, "onset_chunk": 17, "eot_seen": false, "n_speak_chunks": 60, "feed_lag_max_ms": 893, "feed_lag_sum_ms": 3572, "audio_files": {"local": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/frozen/audio/q0103_conservative_local.wav", "sha256": "eb0786ffed1e7a4b839d26abaeed918febf5d9163b370507b607a3b8743c55f6", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 60.0}}, "chunks": [[0, 1, 1.0, 1.084, 1.153, 1, 0, 0], [1, 1, 2.0, 2.083, 2.149, 1, 0, 0], [2, 1, 3.0, 3.083, 3.15, 1, 0, 0], [3, 1, 4.0, 4.083, 4.151, 1, 0, 0], [4, 1, 5.0, 5.085, 5.156, 1, 0, 0], [5, 1, 6.0, 6.087, 6.153, 1, 0, 0], [6, 1, 7.0, 7.087, 7.159, 1, 0, 0], [7, 1, 8.0, 8.087, 8.16, 1, 0, 0], [8, 1, 9.0, 9.083, 9.149, 1, 0, 0], [9, 1, 10.0, 10.086, 10.156, 1, 0, 0], [10, 1, 11.0, 11.085, 11.154, 1, 0, 0], [11, 1, 12.0, 12.088, 12.158, 1, 0, 0], [12, 1, 13.0, 13.084, 13.15, 1, 0, 0], [13, 1, 14.0, 14.083, 14.147, 1, 0, 0], [14, 1, 15.0, 15.088, 15.157, 1, 0, 0], [15, 1, 16.0, 16.088, 16.155, 1, 0, 0], [16, 1, 17.0, 17.083, 17.15, 1, 0, 0], [17, 1, 18.0, 18.087, 18.705, 0, 24000, 0], [18, 1, 19.0, 19.088, 19.935, 0, 24000, 0], [19, 1, 20.0, 20.085, 20.86, 0, 24000, 0], [20, 1, 21.0, 21.083, 21.833, 0, 24000, 0], [21, 1, 22.0, 22.087, 22.872, 0, 24000, 0], [22, 1, 23.0, 23.091, 23.916, 0, 24000, 0], [23, 1, 24.0, 24.088, 25.019, 0, 24000, 0], [24, 1, 25.0, 25.105, 25.843, 0, 24000, 0], [25, 1, 26.0, 26.089, 26.913, 0, 24000, 0], [26, 1, 27.0, 27.089, 27.904, 0, 24000, 0], [27, 1, 28.0, 28.084, 28.778, 0, 24000, 0], [28, 1, 29.0, 29.09, 29.869, 0, 24000, 0], [29, 1, 30.0, 30.082, 30.887, 0, 24000, 0], [30, 1, 31.0, 31.086, 31.774, 0, 24000, 0], [31, 1, 32.0, 32.082, 32.849, 0, 24000, 0], [32