{"id": "q0530", "pool": "frozen", "arm": "conservative", "tier": "conservative", "lang": "en", "run_id": "ttfa1", "attempt": 1, "seed": 2258117728, "protocol": "ttfa-v3", "config_sha256": "1bd884090589f25ac8e99f9bb754f4b90b4c7a09d6887616d0aefbdba25a74d4", "gate_art_sha256": "0e6494c2eeac9bcd86c10b5def3cbd32e98bb0765fa2fd8afc8c1b47915ea372", "threshold": 0.9057239890098572, "gpu": "NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3", "host": "modal", "shard": 5, "query": "描述数据存储的各种方法。", "input_path": "/data/audio_pool/q0530.wav", "input_sha256": "d3c9a18d8228694bfb13f92c0a870308de19457a769f2b28f54544da1257bed9", "input_samples": 37400, "input_s": 2.337, "n_real_chunks": 3, "score": 0.3143, "act": 0.9971, "is_info": true, "fired": false, "mode": "local", "answer": "数据存储的方法有很多，主要有文件系统、数据库系统和云存储。文件系统是最基础的，比如我们常用的硬盘，把文件保存成单个的文件，方便管理。数据库系统则更适合处理大量结构化数据，像关系型数据库或非关系型数据库，能实现快速查询和管理。云存储则是通过网络把数据上传到远程服务器上，比如网盘或云服务，可以随时随地访问，还方便备份。另外还有快照技术、固态硬盘和分布式存储等，根据需求选择不同方式来保证数据安全和高效利用。", "relay_text": "", "expert_answer": "", "transcript": "", "asr_s": null, "expert_s": null, "expert_input_samples": null, "expert_input_s": null, "expert_input_sha256": null, "expert_timed_out": false, "wait_s": null, "relay_synth_ms": null, "onset_chunk": 3, "eot_seen": true, "n_speak_chunks": 44, "feed_lag_max_ms": 235, "feed_lag_sum_ms": 1195, "audio_files": {"local": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/frozen/audio/q0530_conservative_local.wav", "sha256": "340e4eb5454f6a856b5e1fdab884c6fbca5b779112e63773f81f33a9b2350d2f", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 44.24}}, "chunks": [[0, 1, 1.0, 1.086, 1.155, 1, 0, 0], [1, 1, 2.0, 2.085, 2.155, 1, 0, 0], [2, 1, 2.337, 2.421, 2.488, 1, 0, 0], [3, 0, 3.337, 3.424, 4.178, 0, 24000, 0], [4, 0, 4.338, 4.423, 5.232, 0, 24000, 0], [5, 0, 5.338, 5.422, 6.132, 0, 24000, 0], [6, 0, 6.338, 6.423, 7.197, 0, 24000, 0], [7, 0, 7.338, 7.424, 8.176, 0, 24000, 0], [8, 0, 8.338, 8.425, 9.149, 0, 24000, 0], [9, 0, 9.338, 9.425, 10.162, 0, 24000, 0], [10, 0, 10.338, 10.426, 11.187, 0, 24000, 0], [11, 0, 11.338, 11.447, 12.38